{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Ride publish cheyyan enthokke details venam?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Ride publish cheyyan starting point, destination, departure date and time, available seats, luggage space undenkil athu, passenger contribution/fare, pickup details enniva ready aakkuka. App chodikkunna fields fill cheythu publish cheyyunnathinu munpu details verify cheyyuka."}]}
{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Njan driver aanu. Perumbavoor ninnu Kakkanad vare nale trip post cheyyanam."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Sheri. Perumbavoor aanu starting point, Kakkanad aanu destination. Nale enna date app-il select cheyyuka, departure time, available seats, pickup point, passenger contribution enniva add cheyyuka. Njan trip publish cheythennu parayaan kazhiyilla; app-il submit cheythu confirmation kaanuka."}]}
{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Pickup point exact aayi evide kodukkanam?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Passengerinu kandethaan eluppamulla, safe aaya public pickup point select cheyyuka. Landmark allenkil map pin correct aanennu verify cheyyuka. Private address share cheyyunnathinu pakaram avashyamulla pickup details mathram share cheyyuka."}]}
{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Ente pickup location map-il thettayi kaanikkunnu."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Map pin correct location-il move cheyyuka, pinne place nameum landmarkum verify cheyyuka. GPS location inaccurate aanenkil nearby known landmark use cheyyam. Correct location confirm cheyyathe trip publish cheyyaruthu."}]}
{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Trip-il randu pickup points add cheyyan pattumo?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "App multiple pickup points support cheyyunnundo ennathine aashrayikkum. Trip create cheyyumbol additional stop option undo enn nokkuka. Option illenkil trip details-il oru pickup point mathram set cheythu passengersodu route clarify cheyyuka."}]}
