{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Passengerinu oru suitcase undu. Ride share cheyyumbol luggage details evide parayanam?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "App-il luggage or trip notes field undenkil suitcase sizeum space requirementum avide mention cheyyuka. Luggage space confirm cheyyathe available aanu ennu urappu kodukkaruthu; driverum passengerum travelinu munpu agree cheyyanam."}]}
{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Njan route maatti. Passenger-ne engane ariyikkam?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Trip details update cheyyan app option undenkil route maatti save cheyyuka, pinne affected passengers-ne app-inte official messaging/notification vazhi ariyikkuka. Route change avarude pickup allenkil arrival affect cheyyunnengil avarude agreement vanguka."}]}
{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Ride share cheyyumbol fare engane split cheyyunnu?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Fare split app-inte rulesum trip publish cheytha contributionum anusarichayirikkum. App display cheyyunna amountum payment termsum check cheyyuka. Exact fare data illathe njan amount calculate cheythu urappikkilla."}]}
