{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Oru ride request-il destination clear alla. Entha chodikkendathu?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Destination evideyaanu ennu clear aayi chodikkuka. City/area mathram porenkil exact landmark allenkil map pin chodikkam. Destination confirm aakunnathinu munpu matching ride undennu parayaruthu."}]}
{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Njan Kochi city-il ninnu airportilekku shared ride nokkunnu. Enth details venam?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Pickup area, airport terminal allenkil drop-off point, travel date, approximate departure time, passengersude ennam enniva parayuka. Live ride options kaanikkaan ride-search system-il current listings venam; athu illathe availability confirm cheyyan kazhiyilla."}]}
{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Driver aayi trip publish cheythal passengers automatic aayi confirm aakumo?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Ath app-inte booking flow anusarichayirikkum. Trip publish cheyyunnathu mathram passenger booking confirm aayi enna artham alla. App-il booking requestsum accepted/confirmed statusum separate aayi check cheyyuka."}]}
